          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyana kaIsarela dichi chabulilaŋawu kudya mujila wakulukuma, nilelu tuhu chochu; nanochu chakwatiliyi mulutuŋiu lwekata daYakoba mumujila wamulukuma.",
          "type": "text",
